<title>吉隆泥石流灾害已致43人遇难519人失联</title>
<link>http://weixin.sogou.com/weixin?type=2&amp;query=%E7%8E%AF%E7%90%83%E6%97%B6%E6%8A%A5+%E5%90%89%E9%9A%86%E6%B3%A5%E7%9F%B3%E6%B5%81%E7%81%BE%E5%AE%B3%E5%B7%B2%E8%87%B443%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%87%E9%9A%BE519%E4%BA%BA%E5%A4%B1%E8%81%94</link>
